          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While your units are visible to this unit they gain the following ability:


Lord's Mandate: For each attack this unit makes, reroll a Wound Roll of 1 for that attack.</characteristic>
