          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated, select one of the following abilities. Then, this unit gains the selected ability until the End step:

REPAIR: After this unit's Move step, select up to one other unit within 4” with Living Metal. That unit uses Living Metal.


REPLICATE: After this ability is gained, add one model to this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Auto-Routines" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="7640-f461-ab8f-e539">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit has no leader model, this unit cannot capture objectives or be selected to gain relics and after this unit's End step, if this turn was your first turn in a row, take another turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
