    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Canoptek Reanimator" hidden="false" id="ad55-5557-8830-949c" sortIndex="23">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="80" />
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Reanimator Subroutines" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="926f-760c-77e8-e9ab">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated, select one of the following abilities. Then, this unit gains the selected ability until the End step:


NARROW NANOSCARAB BEAM: After this unit’s Move step, select another friendly unit within 16” of and visible to this unit. Then, for each selected unit, roll 1 D6 for each of its missing Health. For each 4+, the selected unit Repairs 1.


WIDE NANOSCARAB BEAM: After this unit’s Move step, select up to two different friendly units within 9” of and visible to this unit. Then, for each selected unit, roll 1 D6 for each of its missing Health. For each 5+, that unit Repairs 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <entryLinks>
