        <profile name="Wraith Subroutines" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="141c-494b-feb1-4f99">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated, select one of the following abilities. Then, this unit gains the selected ability until the End step:

SOW TERROR: After this unit’s Move step, each enemy unit within 8” of this unit suffers 1+D3 Suppression.

ISOLATE INTRUDER: For each melee attack this makes, that attack gains Isolate and Shred.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
